    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nThe configuration check compares the boolean `paste` option to 1, so it never reports that the option is enabled.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nCheck the boolean value directly and cover enabled and disabled states.\r\n\r\nPersonally, don't think regression test is needed, but left it just in case.",
